176
00:08:26,862 --> 00:08:29,080
So you have a chatbot
which is hello, how can I

177
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:30,290
assist you as an answer.

178
00:08:30,290 --> 00:08:32,120
How does this actually happen?

179
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:36,669
It is saying one word
at a time by just

180
00:08:36,669 --> 00:08:37,850
