181
00:08:37,850 --> 00:08:40,210
So how goes through
Claude and predicts

182
00:08:40,210 --> 00:08:43,270
can and how can goes to I
and how can I goes to assist

183
00:08:43,270 --> 00:08:45,190
and how can I assist
goes to you so you

184
00:08:45,190 --> 00:08:49,630
can reduce the problem to the
computation that gives you

185
00:08:49,630 --> 00:08:52,900
the next word.

186
00:08:52,900 --> 00:08:54,380
And that is a neural network.

187
00:08:54,380 --> 00:08:56,770
Here I've drawn like a
fully connected network

188
00:08:56,770 --> 00:08:58,878
to turn language into language.

189
00:08:58,878 --> 00:09:01,420
Passing through numbers, you
have to turn things into vectors

190
00:09:01,420 --> 00:09:01,920
