191
00:09:01,920 --> 00:09:03,170
So there's the embeddings.

192
00:09:03,170 --> 00:09:05,620
So every word or token
in the vocabulary

193
00:09:05,620 --> 00:09:08,890
has an embedding, which is a
list of numbers or a vector.

194
00:09:08,890 --> 00:09:11,560
Morally speaking, you basically
just concatenate those together

195
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:15,820
and run them through a
massive neural network

196
00:09:15,820 --> 00:09:19,180
with a lot of weights,
outcomes, a score

197
00:09:19,180 --> 00:09:21,520
for every word in the
vocabulary and the model

198
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:24,370
says the highest scoring
word modulo some temperature

199
00:09:24,370 --> 00:09:26,230
