200
00:09:26,230 --> 00:09:28,202
Transformer architectures
are more complex.

201
00:09:28,202 --> 00:09:29,660
There's these
residual connections,

202
00:09:29,660 --> 00:09:32,740
alternating attention and MLP
blocks, which you could think

203
00:09:32,740 --> 00:09:38,950
