to be that interesting.

219
00:10:21,590 --> 00:10:26,870
So of course, we have
the models and so--

220
00:10:26,870 --> 00:10:29,188
and so there is a
tautological answer

221
00:10:29,188 --> 00:10:31,230
to what are they doing,
which I already told you,

222
00:10:31,230 --> 00:10:32,980
which is they turn the
words into numbers.

223
00:10:32,980 --> 00:10:34,320
They do a bunch of matmuls.

224
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,650
They apply simple functions.

225
00:10:36,650 --> 00:10:38,137
It's just math all
the way through.

226
00:10:38,137 --> 00:10:40,470
And then you get something
out and it's like, that's it.

227
00:10:40,470 --> 00:10:41,810
That's what the model does.

228
00:10:41,810 --> 00:10:46,520
And I think that's an
unsatisfying answer because you

229
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:48,210
