559
00:25:14,250 --> 00:25:18,420
And I think the learning problem
is just a lot-- a lot easier.

560
00:25:18,420 --> 00:25:21,150
It's also like slightly
less clear what the thing

561
00:25:21,150 --> 00:25:22,942
to replace the
