565
00:25:29,110 --> 00:25:31,460
And sparsity isn't a
good priority there.

566
00:25:31,460 --> 00:25:33,710
You've got like a four tensor
instead of a two tensor,

567
00:25:33,710 --> 00:25:35,660
and we aren't sure what
the right answer is.

568
00:25:35,660 --> 00:25:39,010
So we just did this for now.

569
00:25:39,010 --> 00:25:40,720
[INAUDIBLE]

570
00:25:40,720 --> 00:25:44,242

571
00:25:44,242 --> 00:25:46,575
--your interpretation of what
