00:26:06,470 --> 00:26:06,970
Yeah.

579
00:26:06,970 --> 00:26:09,460
[INAUDIBLE]

580
00:26:09,460 --> 00:26:10,840
Yeah.

581
00:26:10,840 --> 00:26:13,790
Well, so the sparse autoencoder
