the next to the sum,

1127
00:52:07,493 --> 00:52:08,660
you add the next to the sum.

1128
00:52:08,660 --> 00:52:11,830
And you do 100 serial steps.

1129
00:52:11,830 --> 00:52:13,350
To do that with
a transformer, it

1130
00:52:13,350 --> 00:52:16,240
would need to be
100 layers deep.

1131
00:52:16,240 --> 00:52:18,290
But there's another
thing you can do,

1132
00:52:18,290 --> 00:52:24,040
which is could add pairs
consecutively in one layer

1133
00:52:24,040 --> 00:52:26,320
and then add the pairs
of pairs consecutively

1134
00:52:26,320 --> 00:52:29,690
in the next, and then the pairs
of those pairs in the next.

1135
00:52:29,690 --> 00:52:34,870
And so in log n depth, you
could add up the 100 numbers.

1136
00:52:34,870 --> 00:52:37,780
